  unless status_shock
  need has_nayrus_love
  unless status_nayru
  take 24 magic
  give 24 magic_spent
  give 60 status_nayru
  give enemy_turn

verb link_lens_on "Link looks through the Lens of Truth" by link in link_moves at 2820 1340
  take link_turn
  unless lens_on
  need has_lens_of_truth
  need magic
  give lens_on
  give link_turn

verb link_lens_off "Link puts the Lens away" by link in link_moves at 2680 1410
  take link_turn
  take lens_on
  give link_turn

